{"inkVersion":21,"root":[[{"->":"DRAGON_01"},["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"DRAGON_01":[["#","^speaker: 2001","/#","#","^face: 2001: Spiri_Dragon","/#","#","^anim: cold","/#","^...네가 용사인가. 나는 스피리다. 붉은 재앙의 용... [pause=0.25]스피리. ","#","^loc:dialogue.dragonbossintrodialogue_spirinotion_animated.9d356ac5a4","/#","\n","#","^face: 2001: Spiri_Dragon","/#","#","^anim: slow","/#","^이유를 모르겠군. 네놈에게선... [pause=0.35]아무 냄새도 나지 않아. ","#","^loc:dialogue.dragonbossintrodialogue_spirinotion_animated.4adb1425bb","/#","\n","#","^face: 2001: Spiri_Dragon","/#","#","^anim: cold","/#","^공포도. 살의도. 생존 본능조차. ","#","^loc:dialogue.dragonbossintrodialogue_spirinotion_animated.2a68c617ea","/#","\n","#","^face: 2001: Spiri_Dragon","/#","#","^anim: slow","/#","^...그 정도로 약한 건가? [pause=0.25]아니면 이미 각오를 끝낸 건가. ","#","^loc:dialogue.dragonbossintrodialogue_spirinotion_animated.6e65686948","/#","\n","#","^face: 2001: Spiri_Dragon","/#","#","^anim: slow","/#","^... ","#","^loc:dialogue.dragonbossintrodialogue_spirinotion_animated.6eae3a5b06","/#","\n","#","^face: 2001: Spiri_Dragon","/#","#","^anim: slow","/#","^...미안하지만 잠시 기다려주겠나. 지금의 나는... [pause=0.35]그다지 바람직한 상태가 아니라서. ","#","^loc:dialogue.dragonbossintrodialogue_spirinotion_animated.07de708c80","/#","\n","#","^face: 2001: Spiri_Drink","/#","#","^anim: slow","/#","#","^CameraShake: Low","/#","^(<size=110%>벌컥</size>) ","#","^loc:dialogue.dragonbossintrodialogue_spirinotion_animated.77b65f9777","/#","\n","#","^face: 2001: Spiri_Drink","/#","#","^anim: slow","/#","#","^CameraShake: Middle","/#","^(<size=115%>벌컥</size>) ","#","^loc:dialogue.dragonbossintrodialogue_spirinotion_animated.3c6d679039","/#","\n","#","^face: 2001: Spiri_Drink","/#","#","^anim: angry","/#","#","^CameraShake: High","/#","^(<size=110%>벌컥</size><size=115%>벌컥</size><size=120%>벌컥벌컥--!!</size>) ","#","^loc:dialogue.dragonbossintrodialogue_spirinotion_animated.77bb4c842f","/#","\n","#","^face: 2001: Spiri_DrunkShout","/#","#","^anim: angry","/#","^[slowshake][rand_size=95,1